[hammer]:
It's nice and weighty. Perhaps you want to [[hit yourself in the face with it]](hit)?

[[hit]]:
    squiffy.ui.transition(() => new Promise(resolve => {
        const blackout = document.createElement("div");
        Object.assign(blackout.style, {
            position: "fixed", inset: "0", background: "black",
            opacity: "0", transition: "opacity 3s ease-in"
        });
        squiffy.element.appendChild(blackout);

        // Fade to black
        requestAnimationFrame(() => blackout.style.opacity = "1");

        setTimeout(() => {
            squiffy.story.go("wake up");

            // Fade back in, then tidy up
            blackout.style.opacity = "0";
            blackout.addEventListener("transitionend", () => {
                blackout.remove();
                resolve();
            }, { once: true });
        }, 4000);
    }));

Bang.

[[wake up]]:
@clear
Slowly your eyes open.

That was a rather stupid thing to do.
